Practical Coding Assignment
End-to-End Data Preprocessing for House Price Prediction
Maximum Marks: 40
Submission:
•	Jupyter Notebook (.ipynb) 
•	Python Script (.py) 
•	PDF Report (Maximum 5 pages) 

Objective
The objective of this assignment is to apply all the data preprocessing techniques covered up to Week 7 to prepare a housing dataset for machine learning. Students are expected to clean, transform, encode, engineer features, and prepare a final dataset suitable for predictive analytics.
Business Scenario
A real estate company wants to build a machine learning model to predict house prices. Before model development, the collected housing dataset must be cleaned and transformed because it contains missing values, inconsistent categorical values, duplicate records, skewed numerical features, and attributes measured on different scales. As a Data Scientist, your responsibility is to prepare the dataset for model development.
